{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3000_situation", "source_sha256": "fe546a32ec6e574abf3143fa2af1b5425e28a2c754cff9209e7f11cc01f05661", "ja": "ドラマのオーディション　直前", "zh": "戏剧试镜　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3001_p", "source_sha256": "c7d5b11be9c11b9e1be74f742c73cfc47eb84ead84ebbab705f86719183eec7b", "ja": "（もうすぐ、瑞希のオーディションが始まる。\nだが、瑞希は何か考えこんでいるようだ……）", "zh": "（瑞希的试镜就要开始了，\n但瑞希似乎还若有所思……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3002_p", "source_sha256": "8ae249e73e0450b65732b4113c7dc5a62144c57e946abcff828ea50f1e7291b6", "ja": "瑞希、どうかしたのか？\n悩みがあるなら、俺が聞くけど……。", "zh": "瑞希，怎么了吗？\n要是有什么烦恼，我可以听你说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3003_044miz", "source_sha256": "33f5190c637e36e4fa218d0fd90230cbb4d4c3310746adeb97704f3d34df4888", "ja": "{$P$}。ありがとうございます。\n実は、相談したいことがあります。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n其实我有件事想商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3004_044miz", "source_sha256": "b61d97874af0c8bf142ac5d4fe8dc6876f21995500934f0e8599cee8f3c3ef58", "ja": "今回のオーディションでは、自己PRをする必要が\nあります。しかし、何をすればいいのかわかりません。", "zh": "这次的试镜需要进行自我推销，\n但我不知道该做什么才好，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3005_044miz", "source_sha256": "7a144d7b014b31b5b358c69fa0d55a6741a716f31fabbb7942b986a69bec93e5", "ja": "自己PR、どうすればいいのでしょうか。\n……難しいな。", "zh": "自我推销该怎么做才好呢？\n……好难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3006_p", "source_sha256": "6c57fd3e4777544b810de40bfa1f3c29756f47a5444edaed6884bb55009c7393", "ja": "それなら、瑞希の特技を披露すればいいんじゃないか？\nほら、瑞希の得意な……。", "zh": "那就表演瑞希的特技吧？\n就表演那个啊，瑞希擅长的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3007", "source_sha256": "0012573d0fab68d7fbcdb560b05a588b64c83cdf6e3cf2b79da7a779f2e02edd", "ja": "マジック", "zh": "魔术", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3008", "source_sha256": "50cb7d18802990defbd4d10f1dcc0ce20f792f9beb7970b20541405ad8cd0b6a", "ja": "バトントワリング", "zh": "舞棒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3100_p", "source_sha256": "ef7e714a2ddec017d1a5d8189a2894830ef4d67e921c730e807c2c6b00692dd4", "ja": "マジックなんてどうだ？", "zh": "魔术怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3101_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e42d953c44d0abdde6a2eb1edb4b93583a90368a11318ca08d916c53011b2c6", "ja": "なるほど、いい考えです。私のマジックで審査員の\n方々をあっと驚かせて、役を手に入れてみせます。", "zh": "有道理，这个点子真不错。我要用魔术\n惊艳所有评审，然后得到这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3200_p", "source_sha256": "ef7e714a2ddec017d1a5d8189a2894830ef4d67e921c730e807c2c6b00692dd4", "ja": "マジックなんてどうだ？", "zh": "魔术怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3201_044miz", "source_sha256": "bffb68673cdcd314ab2a18b86aaa4cdf9cf8cb38c963969e702230a7dbb2008b", "ja": "なるほど。ただ、ひとつ問題が……はい。手元に、\n道具がありません。……コイン、貸してもらえますか。", "zh": "有道理，但有一个问题……是的，那就是我的手边\n没有道具……可以借我硬币吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3400_p", "source_sha256": "71511bb446ce2fd1558bc773a1bdd9f90d9acee515ae5d568728130d816cf893", "ja": "バトントワリングはどうだ？", "zh": "舞棒怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3401_044miz", "source_sha256": "a2d628451d53ce29a463cc23a3771bce891df41e4dfe7959b823ae4f2b3a2c09", "ja": "それなら、オーディションで目立てそうです。\n……審査員を魅了するぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "这样一来，在试镜中应该也会很引人注目。\n……要迷住评审啰，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3500_p", "source_sha256": "71511bb446ce2fd1558bc773a1bdd9f90d9acee515ae5d568728130d816cf893", "ja": "バトントワリングはどうだ？", "zh": "舞棒怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_3501_044miz", "source_sha256": "29ba0f5a46921181243cc47732f45ed8ef2951474f6f503b053a746542347c93", "ja": "ひとつ心配なことが。会場の天井が低いと、\nバトンを投げられません。……天井、高いといいな。", "zh": "有一件令人担心的事，要是会场的天花板很低，\n就无法丢棒子了……希望天花板够高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
